    <string name="your_privacy">Your privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Camera access is used only while AR Drawing is open.\n\nPhotos and videos are created and stored on your device. Your captured drawings are not uploaded by the app.\n\nDrawing categories and reference images are loaded from the AR content service.</string>
    <string name="using_ar_drawing">Using AR Drawing</string>
    <string name="terms_body">Use only images you have permission to trace or share.\n\nKeep your phone secure while drawing and do not operate the camera where device use is unsafe.\n\nFollow local laws and respect the rights of image owners when publishing your work.</string>
    <string name="how_ar_drawing_works">How AR Drawing works</string>
    <string name="help_body">1. Choose a reference\nPick a template or image from your device.\n\n2. Place your phone\nKeep the camera steady above your paper.\n\n3. Adjust the overlay\nMove, zoom, flip and change opacity as needed.\n\n4. Trace and save\nDraw on paper, then capture or record your result.</string>
